OL,3,GNEWSADeath of man who went overboard
OL,4,Afrom cruise ship 'not suspicious'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of a man whose body was
OL,7,Frecovered after going overboard from a
OL,8,Fcruise ship off the east coast of
OL,9,FScotland is not being treated as
OL,10,Fsuspicious, police have confirmed.
OL,12,FThe man was reported missing from
OL,13,FAmbassador Cruise Lines vessel MS
OL,14,FAmbition, about 36 nautical miles from
OL,15,FArbroath, at 08:35 on Friday.
OL,17,FHis body was recovered later that day
OL,18,Ffollowing a major multi-agency search.
OL,20,FThe man's identity has not been
OL,21,Freleased, but Police Scotland said his
OL,22,Fnext of kin had been informed.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
